@startuml
!theme plain
hide empty members
skinparam linetype polyline
top to bottom direction

class "System" as user <<actor>>
class "Failure task" as task <<control>>
class "Site setting" as setting <<entity>>
class "Decision" as decision <<entity>>
class "Message" as message <<boundary>>

user --> task : 1: the task runs
task --> setting : 2: reads the point of the last run
task --> decision : 3: finds the failures since then
task --> message : 4: sends one summary to each teacher
task --> setting : 5: remembers the instant

@enduml
